  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health support MSPAS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">H&#xe4;lsost&#xf6;d MSPAS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenskt programbaseratst&#xf6;d som har som &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa, minska m&#xf6;dra- och barnad&#xf6;dlighet i tre av de fattigaste regionerna i Guatemala. St&#xf6;det anv&#xe4;nder sig av       Guatemalas planerings- och PFM system. En teknisk st&#xf6;d grupp (PAHO,   UNFPA) ger st&#xf6;d i implementeringen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish programme-based support with the overall aim to improve       sexual and reproductive health, reduce maternal and child mortality   in three of the poorest regions in Guatemala. The support is aligned  with Guatemalas planning and Public Financial Management system. A    Technical Support Group (PAHO, UNFPA) is strenthening the             implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
